Z||000013||Lady Pegasus||12-05-2001||08:02 PM||||Ebonics is the "title" for the slang that "african americans" use.  I guess a while ago someone wanted that taught in school.  It's the new "black languge."  Where I grew up, I heard it all the time.  Don't get me wrong, every now and then I jok around with my friends and use the slang, but to actually HEAR people use it from day to day as an actual "language" just makes people sound un-educated.  And in my school, most of the people who talked like that WERE.<P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||4
